{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>El who brings him out of Egypt</b> — this is said twice, to say: just as He brought them out of Egypt, so they will go forth in the time to come." "<b>and their bones</b> — suspended ayin, to tell you that He uproots seven nations, and in the time to come sixty-three nations, and this is altogether sixty-three; they were joined together."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {1 "The suspended ayin in ועצמותיהם is read as a numerical addition: ayin = 70, yielding 7 + 63 = 70 nations total; the phrase ס\"ג יחדו נאלחו is rendered hyper-literally as the text is terse and possibly elliptical."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:03.838991368Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}